repository-code: "https://github.com/DH-Cologne/transcrEval"
abstract: >-
  transcrEval evaluates OCR of historical newspaper pages against a hand-made gold
  standard. It aligns lines by content rather than position, so that displaced lines
  and blocks are reported as reading-order errors instead of inflating the character
  error rate, and adds a coordinate-based line re-sorting step for ALTO input. The
  repository contains the pipeline, an HTML error-review viewer, and the evaluation
  set of ten pages of the Viennese Arbeiter-Zeitung (1919-1934) with gold standard
  and two OCR versions.
